d as `SIGNATURE_NOT_IN_ABI` rather than reporting generic revert errors.\\n4. **Reproducibility \u0026 Compiler Remappings:**\\n   - `compiler_configuration` now embeds the concrete list of project remappings (from `remappings.txt`), optimizer settings (`runs: 200`), and EVM target.\\n   - `raw_output_hashes` are fully populated for all engine runs.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### End-to-End Validation: AaveTokenV3 State Variables\\n\\n#### 1. Implementation Code Trace\\nIn the target implementation contract [`AaveTokenV3`](file:///Users/markstevenson/Documents/eth-audit-pipeline/scan_targets/1_0x5d4aa78b08bc7c530e21bf7447988b1be7991322/src/AaveTokenV3.sol) inheriting from [`BaseAaveToken`](file:///Users/markstevenson/Documents/eth-audit-pipeline/scan_targets/1_0x5d4aa78b08bc7c530e21bf7447988b1be7991322/src/BaseAaveToken.sol):\\n```solidity\\nabstract contract BaseAaveToken is Context, IERC20Metadata {\\n  mapping(address =\u003e DelegationAwareBalance) internal _balances;     // Slot 0\\n  mapping(address =\u003e mapping(address =\u003e uint256)) internal _allowances; // Slot 1\\n  uint256 internal _totalSupply;                                      // Slot 2\\n  string internal _name;                                             // Slot 3\\n  string internal _symbol;                                           // Slot 4\\n  uint8 private ______DEPRECATED_OLD_ERC20_DECIMALS;                  // Slot 5\\n...\\n  function name() public view virtual override returns (string memory) {\\n    return _name;\\n  }\\n  function symbol() public view virtual override returns (string memory) {\\n    return _symbol;\\n  }\\n  function totalSupply() public view virtual override returns (uint256) {\\n    return _totalSupply;\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\nIn [`AaveTokenV3.sol`](file:///Users/markstevenson/Documents/eth-audit-pipeline/scan_targets/1_0x5d4aa78b08bc7c530e21bf7447988b1be7991322/src/AaveTokenV3.sol#L10-L12):\\n```solidity\\ncontract AaveTokenV3 is BaseAaveTokenV2, BaseDelegation {\\n  function initialize() external virtual initializer {}\\n}\\n```\\n- **Getter Path:** `name()`, `symbol()`, and `totalSupply()` read directly from storage slots 3, 4, and 2.\\n- **Write Path:** Neither the constructor nor `initialize()` writes to slots 2, 3, or 4. `initialize()` is an empty stub because `AaveTokenV3` was deployed as an **upgrade implementation** for an existing token proxy whose storage slots were already initialized in V1/V2.\\n\\n#### 2. Storage \u0026 Getter Reads at Block 26,169,719\\n\\n| Storage Slot / Call | Logic Implementation (`0x5d4aa78b...`) | Deployed Proxy (`0x7fc66500...`) | Interpretation |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Slot 2 (`_totalSupply`)** | `0x00...00` (Zero) | `0x...0d3c21bcecceda10000000` | Populated: `16,000,000 * 10^18` |\\n| **Slot 3 (`_name`)** | `0x00...00` (Zero) | `4161766520546f6b656e00...14` | In-place ASCII `\\\"Aave Token\\\"` (len 10) |\\n| **Slot 4 (`_symbol`)** | `0x00...00` (Zero) | `41415645000000...08` | In-place ASCII `\\\"AAVE\\\"` (len 4) |\\n| **Slot 5 (`decimals`)** | `0x00...00` (Zero) | `0x00...12` | Populated: `18` |\\n| **`name()` Decoded** | `\\\"\\\"` (Empty string) | `\\\"Aave Token\\\"` | Valid ERC-20 metadata |\\n| **`symbol()` Decoded** | `\\\"\\\"` (Empty string) | `\\\"AAVE\\\"` | Valid ERC-20 metadata |\\n| **`totalSupply()` Decoded** | `0` | `16,000,000.00 AAVE` | Preserves token supply invariant |\\n| **`DOMAIN_SEPARATOR()`** | Evaluates with empty name | `0x3164404b05fe2af07131d...` | Valid EIP-712 domain separator |\\n\\n#### 3. Invariant Evaluation \u0026 Conclusion\\n- **Expected Invariant:** `totalSupply == 16,000,000 * 10^18`, `name == \\\"Aave Token\\\"`, `symbol == \\\"AAVE\\\"`.\\n- **Observed Result:** All invariants evaluate to `True` on the deployed proxy.\\n- **Verdict:** **Intentional implementation-only storage difference (Benign Proxy Architecture Pattern)**.\\n  - The static analysis alerts flagging uninitialized state variables on the implementation bytecode are true positives